# The proxy's build context is this directory, which also holds the three workspaces. It
# needs two files out of it, so everything is excluded and those two are named back in —
# otherwise every proxy build would ship the client, the server and their node_modules to
# the daemon.
#
# This file applies only to builds whose context is `project/`. The server and client images
# build from the repository root and use the .dockerignore there.
*
!Dockerfile
!nginx.conf
